<title>USA: Sunbeam consumer products VP resigns.</title>
<headline>Sunbeam consumer products VP resigns.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunbeam Corp said P. Newton White, executive vice president of consumer products resigned his position for health reasons.</p>
<p>The company also said Don Uzzi, vice president of marketing for the company had been promoted to senior vice president of worldwide marketing. He would have overall responsibility for the company's operations on a global basis, Sunbeam said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
